### Create Community: a guided name, access and invite flow.

## The steps along the top

create-community-step-name = Name
create-community-step-access = Access
create-community-step-invite = Invite

## Each step's title and lead line

create-community-name-title = Name your community
    .lead = Pick a name and, if you like, an icon. You can change both later.
create-community-access-title = Who can join?
    .lead = You can change this later from Invite People.
# The last step of a public community: it has a link to share.
create-community-share-title = Share your invite link
    .lead = Your community is live. Send this link wherever your people are.
# The last step of a private community: picking people to invite.
create-community-invite-title = Invite your friends
    .lead = Only the people you invite can join. Pick some now, or invite them later.

## The form

create-community-icon = Choose community icon
create-community-private = Private
    .desc = Only members can invite other people in.
create-community-public = Public
    .desc = Anyone with an invite link can join. You'll get one to share right away.

## A public community's invite link. Headings are shown in capitals.

create-community-link = Invite Link
create-community-link-enlarge = Enlarge QR code
# $error says what went wrong.
create-community-link-failed = Couldn't create the link. { $error }
create-community-link-preparing = Getting ready
create-community-link-retry = Try Again
create-community-link-copy = Copy Link
create-community-link-copied = Copied
create-community-link-qr = Show QR
create-community-link-note = You can make more links, or turn this one off, anytime in Invite People.

## Buttons

create-community-next = Next
create-community-back = Back
create-community-create = Create Community
create-community-open = Open Community
# $count is how many people are picked; with none, the button reads create-community-invite-none.
create-community-invite = Invite { $count }
create-community-invite-none = Invite
create-community-skip = Skip for now
